/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (While it gives me immense happiness to share with you the service activities of Age Care Foundation, it is also with great expectation and anticipation that we await the launch of the epoch-making Integrated Geriatric & Palliative Care health facility at Gambheeram, Visakhapatnam. The hospital construction, which will herald a new chapter in the 12 year journey of the Foundation, is nearing completion and the Foundation will start services in the new facility very soon. )
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [14]
>>
