/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (I once again thank all the kind hearted donors who have made the dream to become a reality, a dream of having a health care facility to make available specialised medical services of Geriatric and Palliative care in a unique hospital, to the elderly and those suffering from life limiting critical illnesses. )
/E (I once again thank all the kind hearted donors who have made the dream to become a reality, a dream of having a health care facility to make available specialised medical services of Geriatric and Palliative care in a unique hospital, to the elderly and those suffering from life limiting critical illnesses. )
