224 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (I am sure that the continued support, from benevolent donors and well wishers, will help sustain the noble health care initiative of the Foundation. The health care facility is going to provide a wide array of geriatric and palliative care services to those in dire need of such medical care. I appeal to one and all to come forward and lend a helping hand to make this facility a place renowned for geriatric and palliative health care not only in our state but in our country. )
/E (I am sure that the continued support, from benevolent donors and well wishers, will help sustain the noble health care initiative of the Foundation. The health care facility is going to provide a wide array of geriatric and palliative care services to those in dire need of such medical care. I appeal to one and all to come forward and lend a helping hand to make this facility a place renowned for geriatric and palliative health care not only in our state but in our country. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [12]
>>
