374 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (As life expectancy is increasing, the number of elderly people also is increasing. Meeting the complex needs of age related conditions such as dementia requires trained & skilled healthcare providers and facilities. The unique needs of these patients can't be met adequately by hospitals alone.)
/E (As life expectancy is increasing, the number of elderly people also is increasing. Meeting the complex needs of age related conditions such as dementia requires trained & skilled healthcare providers and facilities. The unique needs of these patients can't be met adequately by hospitals alone.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
375 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (In the Indian context, there is a need for clinics, outreach services, social workers, psychologists, to offer dedicated care in this area as dementia affects not only memory but also other areas of behaviour and physical health, necessitating the need for comprehensive management.)
/E (In the Indian context, there is a need for clinics, outreach services, social workers, psychologists, to offer dedicated care in this area as dementia affects not only memory but also other areas of behaviour and physical health, necessitating the need for comprehensive management.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
376 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Aspects such as physical therapy, cognitive stimulation activities integrated with care from general physician, psychologists, Neurology, Psychiatry in hospitals can result in better management of symptoms like anxiety, depression, disorganized behaviour, stress etc., leading to improved quality of life of the persons with Dementia. )
/E (Aspects such as physical therapy, cognitive stimulation activities integrated with care from general physician, psychologists, Neurology, Psychiatry in hospitals can result in better management of symptoms like anxiety, depression, disorganized behaviour, stress etc., leading to improved quality of life of the persons with Dementia. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
