380 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Lack of Awareness and stigma is leading to delayed diagnosis & treatment. Most of the time people confuse dementia with just age related cognitive decline. Most of the specialized health care facilities are located in urban areas, making it difficult to access for people in rural areas. There is shortage of neurologists, geriatricians, psychiatrists & clinical psychologists in rural areas making the treatment a challenge. Coverage of insurance is often not available, or inadequate. Caregiving for Dementia can be costly and getting trained homecare service providers is difficult.)
/E (Lack of Awareness and stigma is leading to delayed diagnosis & treatment. Most of the time people confuse dementia with just age related cognitive decline. Most of the specialized health care facilities are located in urban areas, making it difficult to access for people in rural areas. There is shortage of neurologists, geriatricians, psychiatrists & clinical psychologists in rural areas making the treatment a challenge. Coverage of insurance is often not available, or inadequate. Caregiving for Dementia can be costly and getting trained homecare service providers is difficult.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
