/E (Training more staff to reach the rural population, conducting awareness & screening programs, conducting walks, rallies to raise awareness and reduce stigma, making the cognitive stimulation activities tailor made to Indian population, developing screening tools that can be easily administered to rural populations. )
/Pg 15 0 R
