/T (Setting up facilities like Nightingales Medical Trust, Bengaluru is an ideal model to replicate in other parts of the country. The upcoming geriatric and palliative health care facility by AGE CARE FOUNDATION is going to be a classic example for filling the void for Dementia and Palliative care in Andhra Pradesh.)
